d><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.0070</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote2"><label/><p>CR&#x0003d;complete response; PR&#x0003d;partial response; NC&#x0003d;no change; PD&#x0003d;progressive disease; AFP&#x0003d;alpha-fetoprotein; PIVKA-II&#x0003d;protein induced by vitamin K antagonists or absence.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>